('neco','04903394-7e23-4154-bcfe-f1b6236ef47a'::uuid,'Measurements & Units','What is the SI base unit for amount of substance?','[{"id":"A","text":"mole"},{"id":"B","text":"second"},{"id":"C","text":"metre"},{"id":"D","text":"kilogram"}]'::jsonb,'A','The SI base unit for amount of substance is the mole (mol).','easy','BIPM SI base units','https://www.bipm.org/en/measurement-units/si-base-units','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
