('neco','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Under Nigeria''s 1999 Constitution, legislative powers are primarily addressed in which section?','[{"id":"A","text":"Section 4"},{"id":"B","text":"Section 5"},{"id":"C","text":"Section 6"},{"id":"D","text":"Section 7"}]'::jsonb,'A','Section 4 concerns legislative powers.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('neco','e3b0d03f-acf7-4ddb-9755-7f4072459e76'::uuid,'Constitution & Legislature','Which chamber is commonly called Nigeria''s Green Chamber?','[{"id":"A","text":"Supreme Court"},{"id":"B","text":"Council of State"},{"id":"C","text":"House of Representatives"},{"id":"D","text":"Senate"}]'::jsonb,'C','The House of Representatives is commonly referred to as the Green Chamber.','medium','National Assembly of Nigeria','https://nass.gov.ng/about/item/1548','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
